# 🧪 Bitlings Internal QA Test Checklist

_Comprehensive testing guide for your pre-release mobile build (Google Play / App Store)._

---

## 🟢 1. General Setup & Startup

| ✅  | Test                                          | Tip                                                          |
| --- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| [ ] | Game boots from title screen with no errors   | Watch console for missing references or NullRefs on startup. |
| [ ] | Intro panel opens first, all others hidden    | Ensure PanelManager initializes all inactive.                |
| [ ] | “Press to Continue” animation plays correctly | Confirm LeanTween flashing loop stops after tap.             |
| [ ] | Starter selection appears only on first run   | Delete save and recheck first-time flow.                     |
| [ ] | Home panel loads after starter chosen         | Verify `PanelId.Home` routing.                               |

💡 **Tip:** Play from a fresh install and verify SaveManager’s first-run setup creates `idle_mon_save.json`.

---

## 🟣 2. Save System & Persistence

| ✅  | Test                                       | Tip                                                 |
| --- | ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |
| [ ] | Restart resumes same progress              | Levels, XP, credits, and timers persist.              |
| [ ] | Timed buffs persist after app close        | Force-close mid-boost, reopen, check timers resume. |
| [ ] | Job sites retain workers and stored output | Especially after 1h+ idle or device time change.    |
| [ ] | JSON save + backup both created            | Check `idle_mon_save.json` and backup path.         |
| [ ] | Expired buffs correctly removed on load    | CaptureBand and LuckBooster expiration logic.       |

💡 **Tip:** Move device clock forward to simulate idle time; confirm resources increment correctly.

---

## 🔵 3. Monster System

| ✅  | Test                                     | Tip                                       |
| --- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| [ ] | All owned monsters load correctly        | No missing icons or broken stat displays. |
| [ ] | Type, rarity, and stats display properly | “TYPE:” label white, type color text.     |
| [ ] | View Details opens correct monster info  | Matches MonsterLibrary data.              |
| [ ] | Sorting by name, type, or ID works       | No null sorting crashes.                  |
| [ ] | Team slots persist across sessions       | Add/replace → reload.                     |

💡 **Tip:** Add/remove repeatedly to catch duplicate or stale references.

