## 🔴 4. Battle System

| ✅  | Test                                       | Tip                                    |
| --- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |
| [ ] | Wild battle triggers from Encounter button | Proper random spawn, no stuck UI.      |
| [ ] | Battle log text updates each turn          | Shows attacks, crits, KOs clearly.     |
| [ ] | Crits trigger SFX and higher damage        | Confirm crit chance values work.       |
| [ ] | Player/enemy turns alternate properly      | No double or skipped turns.            |
| [ ] | Bench swap works mid-battle                | Swapped monster resumes next turn.     |
| [ ] | Victory rewards XP + credits                 | Matches battle duration/time survived. |
| [ ] | Defeat safely returns to panel             | No soft locks.                         |

💡 **Tip:** Use different types to verify passive weaknesses/resists.

